{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7f2a4153f9cd3cdb","name":"Gas Grenade","source":{"id":"source:reference-7f2a4153f9cd3cdb","title":"Gas Grenade","revision":20654,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:15:26Z","sha256":"34bd50f6a40c742caf3cacf3edf97786dbbe7ebc7153feb35630a213417f308b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20654","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Gas%20Grenade&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7f2a4153f9cd3cdb","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Gas Grenades deploy an airborne chemical agent that can render unprotected creatures unconscious. A Gas Grenade bursts on contact after being thrown, taking effect in the same round in which it is hurled.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," with a Gas Grenade, you make a single attack roll and compare the result to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," of every target in the Grenade's 4-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," radius. Creatures you hit move -2 steps down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},"; creatures you miss are unaffected. A target with the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Evasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Evasion"}]}," Talent moves only -1 step down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," if hit by the Grenade. Creatures protected from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Atmosphere"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Atmosphere"}," Hazards are unaffected by the attack of a Gas Grenade.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Additionally, the area of the blast is filled with gas, providing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," to all creatures within the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," radius whether or not a creature is affected by the initial blast; likewise, all targets outside the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," radius have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," from any creature within the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," radius. The gas persists until the end of the attacker's next turn, at which point it dissipates. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenades","referenceId":"reference:0288f85b407ca487"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Tiny\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 250\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," -\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," Radius:"]}," 4-Squares\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," -\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
